{
  "ferramenta": "imagegen integrada",
  "referencia": "assets/art/toy-room/environment-sheet.png",
  "prompts": [
    {
      "asset": "armchair-v1.png",
      "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: ONE transparent game furniture sprite for Toy Room. Reference image: the supplied environment atlas is the mandatory STYLE reference, especially the painted red toy chest and round oak table. Create a small child-sized RED UPHOLSTERED ARMCHAIR, immediately recognizable, three-quarter front view with front facing viewer, subtle top view matching those furniture sprites. Required: tall rounded padded backrest, two substantial upholstered armrests, recessed soft seat cushion clearly separate from back, red warm woven fabric texture, visible seams/piping, subtle tufts, short oak feet, credible painted volume and soft integrated contact shadow. Compact nearly square silhouette, whole object, no extra objects. Same warm illustrated digital painting, material detail, soft upper-left golden lighting, dark warm outlines, premium children's fantasy game as the atlas. NOT a chest, NOT a throne, no yellow panel or blue circle, no geometric flat fills, no photorealism, no text or labels, no surrounding room. Transparent background, preserve shadow with alpha, full object with small transparent margins."
    },
    {
      "asset": "rocking-horse-v1.png",
      "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: ONE transparent Toy Room furniture sprite. Mandatory STYLE reference: supplied painted environment atlas, especially oak round table, red chest and wooden train. Create a CLASSIC SMALL WOODEN ROCKING HORSE, unmistakably a horse children's toy, three-quarter side view facing LEFT with visible near side and some top surface, consistent with the atlas perspective. Include sculpted friendly horse head with ears, eye, muzzle, curved neck, oval carved wooden body, small saddle/seat, visible four wooden supports/legs connected to TWO CURVED ROCKER RUNNERS with crossbars. Honey oak grain, warm carved bevels, russet mane/tail, subtle child-safe colored saddle detail. All parts physically connected; immediately recognizable silhouette including head and rocking base. Match warm detailed digital painting, dark warm outlines, softly textured wood and upper-left golden lighting. Integrated soft transparent contact shadow. Compact wider-than-tall silhouette, full object with transparent small margin. No rider, no additional objects, no scene, no text, no flat geometric fills or vector icon style. Transparent background."
    },
    {
      "asset": "cotton-bunny-v1.png",
      "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: ONE transparent collectible toy sprite, Coelhinho de Algodão for Toy Room. Mandatory STYLE reference: supplied environment atlas, especially the brown plush teddy bear Ursinho Pipoca and wooden train. Create a SOFT PALE PINK PLUSH BUNNY, upright seated compact body with tall clearly separate ears, front three-quarter view matching teddy. Soft cotton/plush fibers visible, stitched seams, chubby small paws resting together, two defined feet, rounded friendly muzzle with cream patch and small embroidered pink nose, two expressive dark eyes and friendly expression, pale pink inner ears. Must look like a real stuffed toy from the SAME COLLECTION as the teddy, same warm detailed digital painting, material definition, dark warm outlines, subtle warm upper-left light and soft shadow on the toy. Slightly slender silhouette, ears make it taller than wide; maintain legible muzzle, ears, feet at tiny game sprite size. No extra props/accessories or text, no scene, no painted ground, NO ground/contact shadow because the sprite is also carried. Fully transparent background. Avoid geometric silhouette, flat fills, vector icon, photorealism, modern glossy 3D. Whole toy only with small transparent margins."
    }
  ]
}
